Django 6.x. Unknown URL and unknown slug -> real 404 via handler404; retired paths -> 410; database/upstream down -> 503 (never 404, never a 200 shell). All pages render inside the site layout (base.html, with a <nav> and a link to the home page) and carry noindex. DEBUG must be off in production, otherwise Django serves its debug pages (SEC-007).
