Django 6.x. Contact form delivered by SMTP (EmailMessage.send() raises on failure; never pass fail_silently=True). Success page only after real delivery; delivery failure -> 503 with an error shown. CSRF: CsrfViewMiddleware + {% csrf_token %}. Abuse: cache-based 429 limit (use a shared cache such as Redis or Memcached; LocMemCache counts per process) + visually hidden honeypot (for Cloudflare Turnstile, add its widget and verify cf-turnstile-response server-side before sending). Extends base.html from the error-pages recipe.
